infographic list-column-vertical-icon-arrow
data
  title Our AI Toolchain, Visualized
  desc One main tool per job. No substitutes.
  lists
    - label 1 GridCraft
      desc XLS reports and dashboards with real pivot tables
      icon table
    - label 2 DeckCraft
      desc PowerPoints rendered and QA checked slide by slide
      icon projector screen
    - label 3 EffectCraft
      desc Motion graphics with 60fps headless renders
      icon film
    - label 4 PdfCraft
      desc PDFs built, edited and exported
      icon pdf file
    - label 5 VectorCraft
      desc Designs and infographics, sharp vector shapes
      icon pen
    - label 6 PptxGenJS
      desc PPTX construction library paired with DeckCraft
      icon code
theme
  palette #0A1A2F #5E6B7A #B9C2CE
